    "attributionDetail": "Owner-selected; identity and reuse evidence have NOT been newly verified. Naxos historical island camera context Identity: {} Limitations: {\"publication_status\": \"HELD_FOR_GEOGRAPHIC_AND_QUALITY_REVIEW\", \"exact_site_depiction\": \"Not established. Whole-island context only; the house reef, underwater scenery and precise dive pin are not visible or identified.\", \"relationship\": \"Inventory records a missing main photo for Blue Fin Divers house reef. Independent operator page locates the named dive center and beginner diving at Agios Prokopios on Naxos. It does not explicitly identify this exact house-reef inventory record. SSI direct page opened successfully but extracted content lacked the primary site description; nearby listings are not treated as proof. Association remains provisional.\", \"quality\": \"Whole Naxos is meaningfully visible near the center, with discernible coastline and relief. The unenhanced original is pale and hazy, with numerous dark optical spots and peripheral clouds. It is historical, from 2006, and only 1520 by 1008 pixels. Do not promote to a main photograph without review.\", \"privacy\": \"No recognizable people, private documents, vehicle plates or household details observed at this scale. No new privacy clearance beyond this visual review.\", \"rights\": \"NASA conditions retained in full. No item copyright exception observed. Preserve attribution, no NASA endorsement, no false copyright claims, and applicable third-party or personal rights. This is not an exclusive licence.\", \"coverage_credit\": 0, \"production_changes\": 0, \"provider_contact\": false}  Resized and JPEG re-encoded; hero may be cropped."
