    "attributionDetail": "Owner-selected; identity and reuse evidence have NOT been newly verified. Patmos, Leipsoi and Arkoi island-camera context Identity: Scubago Captain Manolis Wreck guide explicitly places this named wreck by Geranou Cape on the northern side of Patmos bay. Its native site number 721888 matches the inventory SSI source identifier, and the title matches exactly. This verifies a named Patmos locality independently of coordinate proximity. Scubago and SSI are a related guide source family, not two independent corroborators. NASA independently names Patmos in the photographed island group. The exact wreck/reef is not resolved or verified in this image; this remains held regional island context only. Limitations:   Resized and JPEG re-encoded; hero may be cropped."
