    "attributionDetail": "Owner-selected; identity and reuse evidence have NOT been newly verified. Fakarava atoll reef-rim historical camera context Identity: {\"target_site_id\": \"687291a3-a5e9-4aea-a1a3-95eeb9e84ed5\", \"target_name\": \"Alibaba\", \"target_url\": \"https://diveatlas.site/dive-sites/alibaba/\", \"target_needs_main_photo\": true, \"inventory_country\": \"French Polynesia\", \"inventory_coordinates\": [-16.0856, -145.7112], \"coordinates_independently_verified\": false, \"linked_inventory_identity\": \"https://www.divessi.com/mydiveguide/divesite/alibaba-ali-baba-pass-french-polynesia-281797\", \"relationship_source_url\": \"https://kainaplongee.com/en/diving/fakarava-north-pass.html\", \"relationship_source_title\": \"Fakarava North Pass\", \"relationship_source_type\": \"Native local dive operator page, independent of the inventory SSI/OpenDiveMap family\", \"provenance\": \"Successful native page read; not based only on a search snippet.\", \"source_fact_summary\": \"Kaina Plongée places Alibaba in its description of a Garuae pass drift dive in the north of Fakarava. It describes progressing from the oceanic slope through canyons to Alibaba and then into the lagoon. Its same page locates the operator in Fakarava, French Polynesia.\", \"source_short_quote\": \"Alibaba (coral depression)\", \"geographic_scope\": \"Fakarava atoll setting only. The image is not assigned to the underwater canyon or a particular channel segment. The relationship rests on explicit names in independent native sources, not pin proximity.\", \"source_image_reuse\": \"No operator imagery is included or licensed by this packet.\", \"geography_hold\": \"Precise location and visibility of the Alibaba underwater site cannot be verified from this orbital film scan.\"} Limitations: {\"publication_status\": \"HELD_FOR_GEOGRAPHY_AND_QUALITY_REVIEW\", \"details\": [\"Extensive cloud obscures the lower/southern portion of the atoll and lagoon. Substantial rim, shallows and a broad pass-like opening remain clear in the upper/right part.\", \"Soft film texture, subdued contrast, black scan borders and broad historical scale. Hero-image suitability not certified.\", \"The photographed pass-like opening is not independently certified as the exact Alibaba site or Garuae channel. No exact dive-site pixels, entry, route or mooring established.\", \"NASA reports a 25 (11-25)% cloud category; visual review found a more extensive cloudy area. The source bin does not override the visual limitation.\", \"NASA has blank time, nadir, sun-angle and tilt fields and displays an incomplete altitude value ending in (0km). These are missing/incomplete metadata, not verified physical altitude.\"], \"site_coverage_credit\": 0, \"production_assignments\": 0}  Resized and JPEG re-encoded; hero may be cropped."
